"}],"speaker":"UMP45","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"There are more sentries around the armored train than we anticipated.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Our infiltration has been spotted but we have nowhere to fall back to.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"UMP45Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Did someone kick a rock and send it clattering?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"UMP45Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP45","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That would've actually made things simpler.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The enemy's train is on full alert and seems hesitant to enter the city.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"They don't seem to have a new target either after they blew up the Commander's train.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But their infantry have disembarked from the train. We're not seeing any human soldiers, but there are a lot of units that we've never encountered before...","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"All in all, if the Commander wants the plan to go ahead, you'll need to give us a hand.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"UMP45Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Looks like the Commander will have to switch plans."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"UMP45Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"o